. The state administers Basoko town and the Basoko, Yalimbongo and Basali secteurs, with the PNC as the main day-to-day security force and limited FARDC presence. Local land, chieftaincy or plantation disputes may occur but are not known to have produced non-state control. Web research was unavailable for this run, so confidence is medium for Basoko town and low for rural villages."}}